---- MODULE FastFigurePublicApiR38 ----
EXTENDS Sequences, FiniteSets
\* Active direct Source r38 translation; see the translation review for scope/evidence.
\* This is the translation of Source PUBLIC_API_METHODS, not a new runtime registry.
\* Four physical files still ONE logical public-api module. Wrapper invocation below
\* is mechanical procedure binding; arguments/returns are those of Source wrappers.
\* Defaults: Source omitted None -> NoValue; trim=False; explicit task timestamp local.
CONSTANT NoValue
\* Mechanical readers of Source ProjectMutationResult.changed. These do not
\* define another public result contract or read caller plans as committed facts.
AssetPathsFor(changed, role, kind) ==
  LET matches == SelectSeq(changed.assets, LAMBDA item : item.role = role /\ item.kind = kind)
  IN [i \in 1..Len(matches) |-> matches[i].path]
ActualCreatedCsvPath(changed) == AssetPathsFor(changed,"created","csv")[1]
ActualCreatedImagePath(changed) == AssetPathsFor(changed,"created","image")[1]
ActualUpdatedCsvPath(changed) == AssetPathsFor(changed,"updated","csv")[1]
ActualImportedAssetPathsInInputOrder(changed) ==
  LET matches == SelectSeq(changed.assets, LAMBDA item : item.role = "imported")
  IN [i \in 1..Len(matches) |-> matches[i].path]
ActualImportedAssetPath(changed) == ActualImportedAssetPathsInInputOrder(changed)[1]
ActualCreatedDirectoryPath(changed) == changed.createdDirectoryPath
ActualFinalCanonicalDestination(changed) == changed.movedPathTo
